flowchart TD
    CI[Immutable release bundle\nAPI + Worker + Migrator\nmanifests + reviewed SQL]
    APPROVE[Architecture / Database / Operations approval]
    PREFLIGHT[Preflight and dry-run review]
    RESTORE[Create and verify restore point]
    LOCK[Acquire database application lock]
    BOOT[History bootstrap when classified safe]
    MODULES[Auth -> CRM -> Registry -> Holdings -> Transaction]
    VALIDATE[Validate schema, ownership, history and pending IDs]
    WORKER[Deploy compatible Worker consumers and wait Ready]
    API[Roll API producers and check readiness]
    OBSERVE[Smoke tests and compatibility observation]

    CI --> APPROVE --> PREFLIGHT
    PREFLIGHT -->|unexpected state| STOP[Stop release and preserve evidence]
    PREFLIGHT -->|approved| RESTORE --> LOCK --> BOOT --> MODULES --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE -->|failed| STOP
    VALIDATE -->|passed| WORKER --> API --> OBSERVE
